{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'Ferrytown is the perfect place to plant the seeds of accepting and adapting to change, I believe. That was a good idea of yours.'","created_at":"2021-08-16T18:01:45.220000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876888479110402108","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Still, I could think of many counterpoints to it. Even the obvious one - the redcoats starting their attack is a change. But it's not a change we're accepting. so we're making our own change to that.\"\n\n\"Hm, Irynx was right. The more you repeat a word, the less it sounds like one.\"","created_at":"2021-08-16T18:05:17.033000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876889367518539816","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
